    ],
    "rulings": [
      {
        "answer": "No, you can't.  This effect is a [Once Per Turn] effect, therefore it can't activate again during the same turn that it activated for [When Digivolving], even if the timings are different.",
        "question": "Can I activate this card’s [When Digivolving][Main] effect both for a digivolution into this card and for the main phase in the same turn?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "Yes, you can.",
        "question": "When I use this card’s [When Digivolving][Main] effect to play a card with the [Royal Knight] trait, can I activate both this card's effect and my [BT13-007 King Drasil_7D6]'s effect to reduce the play cost according to each respective effect?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "Yes, it does.  Note that this effect applies to \"\"all of your Digimon with the [Royal Knight] trait and all your green Digimon,\"\" therefore any applicable Digimon that are placed in the battle area after this effect activates will also receive ＜Blocker＞.",
        "question": "When I play a card with the [Royal Knight] trait or a green Digimon card, does this card's [All Turns] effect also give ＜Blocker＞ to that played Digimon?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      }
    ]
